  articleID: https://NewManilaColosseum/Events
  title: November Boulevard
  headliner: <b>November Boulevard Lands in New Manila for an upcoming concert !</b>
  bodyText: "Global pop sensation November Boulevard is officially scheduled to touch
    down in New Manila tomorrow ahead of their highly anticipated concert, triggering
    a burst in activity  among the local fanbase.\r\n\r\n Eager supporters from various
    fan clubs have already pitched tents and established makeshift encampments along
    the perimeter of the Colosseum, braving the elements to secure front-row spots.
    \r\n"
  externalLinkBodyText: " Eager supporters from various fan clubs have already pitched
    tents and established makeshift encampments along the perimeter of the Colosseum,
    braving the elements to secure front-row spots. \r\n\r\nLocal businesses are
    reportedly bracing for unprecedented foot traffic and sound levels, while nearby
    street vendors have already begun selling unofficial merchandise at an alarming
    rate. Security personnel urge non-ticket holders to avoid the immediate area,
    though fans insist that no amount of crowd control will prevent them from welcoming
    their favorite band to town. \r\n"
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - I LOVED YOUR COLLAB IT TOIRA DE LA MOREY !
  - I HAVE BEEN WAITING FOR THIS !
  - CAN I GET FREE TICKETS PLEAAAAAAASE !
